SUMMARY:Westmoreland Architecture Walk
DTSTAMP:20260807T044458Z
DTSTART:20260809T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:Architecture Walks begin at 6 p.m. in June\, July\, August and 
	September.When developer W.W. Baldwin laid out Westmoreland Place in 1902\
	, its location on the southwestern side of what is now Midtown was conside
	red the very edge of Houston. Although times have changed\, much of Westmo
	reland's historic character remains\, giving us a fascinating look at the 
	residential architecture of the early 20th-century Bayou City.\n\nhttps://
	www.preservationhouston.org/calendar/2026/8/9/westmoreland-architecture-wa
	lk
URL:https://www.preservationhouston.org/calendar/2026/8/9/westmoreland-arch
	itecture-walk
